to get one...

130
00:05:04,763 --> 00:05:06,723
Except I don't care
about Charlie.

131
00:05:08,058 --> 00:05:09,350
Hey, you guys!
ALL:
Hey!

132
00:05:09,392 --> 00:05:11,436
Okay, you are not
going to believe this.

133
00:05:11,478 --> 00:05:14,522
I just saw my psychic
and she said I was definitely

134
00:05:14,564 --> 00:05:16,608
